{"id":"vod_sn_38042","vodId":"38042","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"头文字D第二季","name_cn":"头文字D第二季","date":"1999-01-01","year":"1999","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c2dd737d8ffca66847ab620c2968bedd.jpg"},"summary":"藤原拓海由于不败的战绩，必然会受到新的挑战。　　《头文字D》的第二部着重突出拓海的成长，当然不乏激烈的挑战。最经典的要数赤诚和依吕波山路两位老大的比拼。年轻的拓海在爱情上触了礁，在输给帝王车队的lanEvo 3后，拓海遇到了人生的挫折，对自己和AE86产生了怀疑，AE86真的有足够的实力吗？　　AE86的重生来自拓海的爸爸文太，他为AE86改装了赛车用引擎。同时，拓海遇到了同样是AE86的强劲对手秋山涉。有意思的是比赛规则是在同一赛道两车来回追赶，直到其中之一能超越对方为止，既要技术又考耐力。胜利让拓海继续接受这辆AE86和重拾信心回到车手的生涯。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:57:49","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BKD05v8ebu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1pf4ijxwAF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nVu8Jq4Kkh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mx7rHzdndd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FisQ2YgAgM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aEzFWb7Kfh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/j95sRzGcuq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yuU2M5A9bV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jeUSySWns91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/D5Xgyu0Lju1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YEZv59FRPK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5UQC312iai1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gkwDxNFXLc1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:03.553Z"}